sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: DSA Dojo predict, reveal and rewind workflow
  accDescr: Challenge Mode gates Next until an answer or skip. Revealing a prediction does not advance the player. Previous selects an earlier stored step. Autoplay is unavailable while Challenge Mode is enabled.
  actor L as Learner
  participant UI as Browser controller
  participant Load as Lesson loader
  participant Trace as Lesson and trace
  participant P as Player reducer
  participant View as Views and source pane
  participant Store as Local storage
  L->>UI: Select lesson and enter input
  UI->>Load: Load selected lesson definition
  Load-->>UI: Cached or newly imported module
  UI->>Trace: Parse input and buildTrace
  alt Invalid input
    Trace-->>UI: Validation error
    UI-->>L: Explain error, request corrected input
  else Valid input
    Trace-->>UI: Structurally validated trace
    UI->>P: LOAD_LESSON or LOAD_INPUT
    P-->>UI: State at initial step
    UI->>View: Render current snapshot and code references
    L->>UI: Enable Challenge Mode
    Note over UI,P: Reset player, build questions from the stored trace
    UI-->>L: Predict the next transition
    L->>UI: Submit prediction or skip
    Note over UI: Store answer and show feedback, player has not advanced yet
    UI-->>L: Reveal actual transition and explanation
    L->>UI: Next
    UI->>P: NEXT
    P-->>UI: Select next stored trace step
    UI->>View: Update visualization, source highlight and Pip
    UI->>Store: Persist state and challenge preferences when available
    L->>UI: Previous
    UI->>P: PREVIOUS
    P-->>UI: Select previous stored step
    UI->>View: Render earlier snapshot, do not reverse algorithm execution
    L->>UI: Disable Challenge Mode, then Play
    Note over UI,P: Disabling Challenge Mode resets the player to the initial step
    UI->>P: PLAY and timer-driven TICK
    P-->>UI: Advance stored steps until complete
    UI->>View: Render selected step
  end
